{"unit_id":"stefanohe__dsh-show-balance#feature-1","repo":"stefanohe/dsh-show-balance","commit":"58b874c0f4cd0d595d434afb7b719eaaf6c0a5b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-show-balance 的功能「状态栏余额」：在会话编辑器底部的 dock 注册余额格，并显示账户主钱包金额。已登录后立即读取，之后每 30 秒刷新；账号未登录或读取异常时不显示余额。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:336-367","client.js:428-449","client.js:514-550"]}
{"unit_id":"stefanohe__dsh-show-balance#feature-2","repo":"stefanohe/dsh-show-balance","commit":"58b874c0f4cd0d595d434afb7b719eaaf6c0a5b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-show-balance 的功能「余额详情面板」：点击状态栏余额打开面板，列出充值、赠金及合计金额；只有账户返回赠金钱包时才显示赠金相关行。点击外部区域、按 Escape 或再次点击余额格可关闭面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:399-423","client.js:442-495"]}
{"unit_id":"stefanohe__dsh-show-balance#feature-3","repo":"stefanohe/dsh-show-balance","commit":"58b874c0f4cd0d595d434afb7b719eaaf6c0a5b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-show-balance 的功能「多币种余额」：面板按币种分别汇总钱包金额，使用加号连接各币种结果；CNY 在中文界面显示为元，其他币种保留代码，不进行汇率换算。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:243-276","client.js:428-448"]}
